	Generous ancient towns have history with thousands of  years, keeping the traditional originally buidings. The river across around and the stone bridges take over on the town,
where local residents settle out with the water. The ancient town keep the local habits and traditional handful arts, which are precious cultural heritage. At present, the ancient 
